## The Markup and CalMatters

Data from The Markup and CalMatters investigation "We caught companies making it harder to delete your personal data online" is licensed under the Apache License 2.0.

- Dataset: https://github.com/the-markup/investigation-data-broker-opt-out-pages
- License: https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0

Rows whose `sources` value includes `markup` use URLs from that dataset. Changes were made, including which URL was kept when a company published more than one and the notes written for this catalog.

## California Privacy Protection Agency

Rows whose `sources` value includes `cppa` use the privacy-rights URL a data broker submitted in the California Data Broker Registry published by the California Privacy Protection Agency.

- Registry: https://www.cppa.ca.gov/data_broker_registry/

The registry page is a government publication. Notes in this catalog were written for this list.

